requently asked questions (FAQ)**\nQ: What types of services do you provide?\nA: We handle HVAC installation and repair, refrigeration, electrical work, plumbing, and commercial appliance repair.\n\nQ: Which areas do you serve?\nA: We serve the greater San Jose and Bay Area communities.\n\nQ: Do you offer same-day service?\nA: Yes. We provide same-day service seven days a week.\n\nQ: What warranty do you offer?\nA: Up to 12 years of labor warranty and up to 12 years on parts.\n\nQ: Are your technicians licensed?\nA: All technicians are fully licensed and certified.\n\nQ: Do you work with residential and commercial customers?\nA: Yes. We service residential, commercial, and industrial properties.\n\nQ: Is there a maintenance plan?\nA: Yes. Our membership includes scheduled preventive maintenance, priority service, and repair discounts.\n\nQ: Do you offer financing?\nA: We provide several financing options and accept utility rebates.")}}

