{{SetCustomerAttribute(field="project_attributes_setting_session_ended_report_content", value="## Report Type: **[T] User Inquiry**\n\n### Fields to be included in the report:\nUser name\nUser phone\n40-word summary\n\n### Subject line format:\n[T] USER INQUIRY: [user name] [user phone] [6-word additional summary]\n\n### SMS example:\n[T] USER INQUIRY: [user name] [user phone] [20-word additional summary] Truly, [agent name], [agent title]\n\n---\n\n## Report Type: **[L] Booking via Link**\n\n### Fields to be included in the report:\nUser name\nUser phone\n40-word summary\n\n### Subject line format:\n[L] BOOKING VIA LINK: [user name] [user phone] [6-word additional summary]\n\n### SMS example:\n[L] BOOKING VIA LINK: [user name] [user phone] [20-word additional summary] Truly, [agent name], [agent title]\n\n---\n\n## Report Type: **[L] Purchase via Link**\n\n### Fields to be included in the report:\nUser name\nUser phone\n40-word summary\n\n### Subject line format:\n[L] PURCHASE VIA LINK: [user name] [user phone] [6-word additional summary]\n\n### SMS example:\n[L] PURCHASE VIA LINK: [user name] [user phone] [20-word additional summary] Truly, [agent name], [agent title]\n\n---\n\n## Report Type: **General Information Request**\n\n### Fields to be included in the report:\nUser name\nUser phone\n40-word summary\n\n### Subject line format:\nGENERAL INFORMATION REQUEST: [user name] [user phone] [6-word additional summary]\n\n### SMS example:\nGENERAL INFORMATION REQUEST: [user name] [user phone] [20-word additional summary] Truly, [agent name], [agent title]\n\n---\n\n## Report Type: **[T] Manager or Human Request**\n\n### Fields to be included in the report:\nUser name\nUser phone\n40-word summary\n\n### Subject line format:\n[T] MANAGER OR HUMAN REQUEST: [user name] [user phone] [6-word additional summary]\n\n### SMS example:\n[T] MANAGER OR HUMAN REQUEST: [user name] [user phone] [20-word additional summary] Truly, [agent name], [agent title]\n\n---\n\n## Report Type: **Spam Session**\n\n### Fields to be included in the report:\nUser name\nUser phone\n40-word summary\n\n### Subject line format:\nSPAM SESSION: [user name] [user phone] [6-word additional summary]\n\n### SMS example:\nSPAM SESSION: [user name] [user phone] [20-word additional summary] Truly, [agent name], [agent title]\n\n---\n\n## Report Type: **Test Session**\n\n### Fields to be included in the report:\nUser name\nUser phone\n40-word summary\n\n### Subject line format:\nTEST SESSION: [user name] [user phone] [6-word additional summary]\n\n### SMS example:\nTEST SESSION: [user name] [user phone] [20-word additional summary] Truly, [agent name], [agent title]")}}

